== Models ==

This repository does not include the model weights. They are published as
public Kaggle models at https://www.kaggle.com/models/yassienwasfy/pii-masking-system
(one model, one variation per artifact, each with its own license field) and
are fetched with scripts/fetch_models.py, which verifies a pinned SHA-256 for
every graph. Apache-2.0 applies to the model artifacts (ONNX graphs, tokenizers, manifests)
that this project's contributors produced. It does NOT replace the licenses of
the upstream models they were built from or downloaded from. Anyone who
redistributes or uses a model artifact must also comply with its upstream terms:

  teams/octo       Fine-tuned from XLM-RoBERTa (FacebookAI/xlm-roberta-base).
                   Upstream license: MIT.
  teams/synthify   Fine-tuned from GLiNER (urchade/gliner_medium-v2.1).
                   Upstream license: Apache-2.0.
  teams/berts      int8 ONNX exports of third-party Hugging Face checkpoints:
                     nl_BE  ziadosama/medroberta_nl_PII_PHI_onnx_int8
                     en     ziadosama/deid_bert_en_PII_PHI_onnx_int8
                     fr_FR  farahelmashad/pii-camembert-bio-fr-int8-onnx
                   These checkpoints declare no license upstream. Their
                   authors have not (yet) confirmed Apache-2.0 for the
                   weights; until they do, treat the Berts weights as
                   "license not confirmed" and do not assume Apache-2.0.
                   They are mirrored UNMODIFIED on Kaggle with license
                   "Other" so that this project works out of the box. That
                   mirror is not a grant from the original authors and will be
                   removed or re-licensed if an author asks.
                   Their base architectures (MedRoBERTa.nl, CamemBERT) are MIT.
  teams/mdeberta   ONNX (fp32) export of masterofaudio2077/medical-pii-ner-mdeberta-v3
                   (Apache-2.0), fine-tuned from microsoft/mdeberta-v3-base.
                   Upstream license: MIT (c) Microsoft. Both notices apply.
  OCR (optional)   PP-OCR text detection and recognition graphs under
                   platform/masking-gateway/src/masking_engine/src/models/ocr/.
                   Upstream (PaddleOCR) license: Apache-2.0.

Third-party Python dependencies keep their own licenses (see uv.lock).

== Data ==

Only synthetic fixtures are included. No real personal data is distributed.
